## Stack

| Sinal | Coleta | Destino |
|-------|--------|---------|
| Traces | OTEL SDK (auto-instrumentation) | {{TRACES_DESTINATION}} |
| Métricas | OTEL SDK + {{METRICS_LIBRARY}} | {{METRICS_DESTINATION}} |
| Logs | {{LOG_LIBRARY}} JSON → OTLP | {{LOGS_DESTINATION}} |

